// Lab 06 – KQL queries against the `stock` table in the stock-store-eventhouse KQL database.
// The table is continuously filled by the stock-data eventstream (Stock market sample source).

// Preview a sample of the captured events
stock
| take 100

// Average bid price per symbol over the last 5 minutes.
// bidPrice is converted with todecimal() before averaging.
// This query was pinned to the "Stock Dashboard" Real-Time Dashboard
// and used as the source for the Activator alert (avgPrice increases by 100).
stock
| where ["time"] > ago(5m)
| summarize avgPrice = avg(todecimal(bidPrice)) by symbol
| project symbol, avgPrice
